{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36872","headline":"中元甲子以辛丑驾幸蜀四首 四 · 罗隐","name":"中元甲子以辛丑驾幸蜀四首 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"白丁攘臂犯长安，翠辇苍黄路屈盘。\n丹凤有情尘外远，玉龙无迹渡头寒。\n静怜贵族谋身易，危惜文皇创业难。\n不将不侯何计是，钓鱼船上泪阑干。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"罗隐","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36872.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36872","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}